<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Tesalonaika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Pepa magigl i, Sailas ya Timoti akie mungo, na Pol pepa i bogl, ene Jisas yugobunomo, dumo Tesalonaika meglkwa i, teiga. Ene Neno Kade God yobama moglsre, Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais ama yobama meglkwa. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Na prika i, Neno Kade God ya nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais ye ene yoko kaima ere wakai ere te moglsre, deno muduno wida di padigl tenabredi prika.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tesalonaika yoba yubun idre, adigl gigledi meglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Agrama abarama wagle, no ege ege ene pre God di wakai yei tenamga paugwa. I siragl pre ene pre mediglkwa i, u gigle kaima dugo, te, ene deno muduno ikne ikne teigwa mabuno i ama ede u podo ogwa. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Yegl pre no Jisas yugobunomo bage bage meglmara wan ede omga igne, no ene mabunono i, ye boglo kugl tedre, Tesalonaika yoba mabuno wakai yegl erimiwe dumga. Yoba ene ere kide ere teigo, ene yubun podo igwa ba ene pre medigl pai moglsre, adigl gigledi meglkwa i pre no yoba di tomga.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adigl gigledi mogl pai moramga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ene yubun teigo, adiglkwa pre God ye ka tage tedre, ene ere wakai ere tenan, kuno kaima erabuka. Te, ene adiglkwa i, ka kaima God yoba kingno morabara suna moraiglkwa i nogugl edugwa. God yoba kingno morabara suna moraiglkwa pre yubun igwa. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Ba yoba erme ene yubun teigwa yobamo i, God ere mogl, ye yubun tenabuka. God yegl erabuka i, ye mabuno du keme ersre, erabuka.<verse eid="2TH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka igne i ye mabuno du ere norsre, ene erme yubun igwa yoba i ya, no God kamo di tomga yoba i bogl, nono akie wakai moglsre, deno muduno wida di inaiglmedi erabuka. Taragl yegl mere plau dinabuka i, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas ye angeloma gigledi meglkwa i bogl akie heven ibo kide kodo, ede unaiglkwa igne i plau dinabuka. Jisas unabuka igne i doga bauglo mere kide ere winabo dinan, ye ede makandigle udre, yoba ka tage tenabuka.<verse eid="2TH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Nono Yaglno Kade Jisas ede ikne udre, yoba ka tage tenabuka igne i ye yoba ta God pre kan erekrikwa i ka tage tedre, te yoba ta Yaglno Kade Jisas kamo wakai i yoba di teigo, prikwa ba mokono tedre, pre mediglkrikwa ta moraiglkwa i, ama ka tage tenabuka. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />God ka tage tenabuka yobamo i, ye ede eglke pidre, Yaglno Kade moglmara moglkre, yobuglomo podo kide paugwa i kankre, aimadi kamin kide kaima moraiglkwa. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Yaglno Kade Jisas unabuka igne i yoba ta ye pre mediglsre, ye yobama meglkwa i, ye Yaglno Kade Jisas wakai kaima mogl, i ta ede moglmedi kandre, ye debie sinaiglkwa. Te, ye yobama moraiglmara suna i, ene ama akie moraiglkwa. I siragl pre no Jisas kamo wakai i ene di tomgo, ene ama pre mediglkwa pre ene ama suna moraiglkwa.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tesalonaika yoba pre kamage erumne dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Yegl pre no ege ege ene pre kamage ere munga. No kamage erumga i, God ene yobuglo bogl tenan, ene mabuno ta eribi, kuno erabere mere yegl eraiglmedi kamage erumga. Ene mabuno yegl eribi, God okuo ene mabunono kandre, Na ene agle di suna edidre, mabuno siragl mere ene eraiglmedi primere mere yegl, ene erimiwe di, yegl dinabedi kamage erumga. Te, ene erme mabuno wakai eramnedi prikwa ya, ene pre mediglmara pre God kogonmo eramnedi nomane si prikwa i pre no ama kamage ersre, God ene yobuglo bogl tenan, ene eramnedi primere mere mudu kaima eraiglmedi kamage erumga. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />No ene pre kamage yegl mere erumga i, Yaglno Kade Jisas ene meglmara suna kogon erabara i mina ye kagie kade inabedi kamage erumga. No Jisas kagie kade inabedi kamage erse, te ene ama, Jisas ene wakai erimiwedi debino sinabedi kamage erumga. Na prika i, nono Godno ya nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais ye nono yoko kaima ere wakai ere noro miurka pre no ene pre kamage erumga i, kaima plau dinabedi prika.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Krais kudamo ikne yagl unabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Agroma abaroma wagle, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais ede ikne unan, nono ye bogl makai sinamga i pre no ene ka tau di tomun, ene pre pogl sinaiglmedi prumga. <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />Yoba tau ene di tedre, Yagl Kade yoba ka tage tenabuka igne i u kodumiwe di, yegl ta dibi, ene nomane sidre, kide prikrio. I siragl pre ye ka kibi digwa. Yoba God Murubuglomo ka yegl di norume dinaiglkwa mo Jisas dedugwa yoba no yegl di norime dinaiglkwa mo ye pepa ta bogl norime dinaiglkwa i, ene ye ka kaima dimedi prikrio. Ye ka kibi digwa.<verse eid="2TH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Yoba ene bakagl te dinaiglmiwa, ene kan kun erio. I siragl pre okna kana taragl tau plau dinan, mokomugl i Yaglno Kade yoba ka tage tenabuka ege i unabuka. Taragl ta komono kana plau dinabuka i, yoba mere kide God kamo sedidre, ye mokono tenaiglkwa. Tebi, yagl ta mabuno kide mina ede okna enabuka i, ede u nogugl enabuka. Yagl i, God ye ere kide ere tenabuka keme paugwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Yagl kide i, yoba taragl kane kane ta god meglmiwe didre, kagno kade teigwa i, ye mane didre, na swara kagna kade nario dinabuka. Ye yegl didre, God yugumo yenabara ede yugugl pi, ame di moglsre, Na nana God moluwe dinabuka. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Nono akie munga igne, na taragl yegl mere plau dinabe digra i, ene pre meglmo mo pre moglkrime?<verse eid="2TH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Na yagl kide ta ede nogugl unabe diga i ede nogugl unabuka ba erme yoba ira ta ye konbomo si kegl di moglkwa i, enene prikwa. Ye konbomo erme si kegl dugwa i, God ye egemo ta padigl togwa i unan keme ye ede u nogugl enabuka pre si kegl dugwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Erme ye unabuka ege i yeikrukwa pre Satan atne, teke konbo u ikne ikne pidre, yoba God kamo sedidre, mokono tenaiglmedi kogon erukwa. Erme yegl erukwa ba yoba ta ye konbomo si kegl dugwa ikra mogl eglke edenabuka igne, <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />yagl ta mabuno kide mina ede okna pidre, yoba God lomo kide kodinaiglmedi erabuka yagl ikra, ede nogugl unan, yoba kanaiglkwa. Yagl i unabuka ba okuo nono Yaglno Kade Jisas abuglagemo podo sinan, Jisas nogugl ede ikne unabuka igne i ye ka dinabara yagl kide i si goglsre, ye kogonmo mudu si dudu kodinabuka.<verse eid="2TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Yagl kide ta okuo unabuka i, Satan ye yobuglo tenan, ye kimagl kane kane erabuka. Ye kimagl kane kane erabara yoba bakagl tenan, ye nagino kogl, ye God yobuglomo idre, kogon erumedi kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Yagl kide i mabuno kide kane kane ersre, yoba tau mere bakagl tenabuka. Ye yoba bakagl tenabuka i, doga kade denaiglkwa meglkwa i, bakagl tenabuka. Ye yoba yegl bakagl tenabuka i, kuno erabuka. I siragl pre yoba i ye God kamo kaima paugwa i wakai prisre, pre mediglma, God ye ere yugo, ba ye God kamo prikre, mokono teigwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Yoba i ye God kamo kaima paugwa i prakiurkwa i pre God ere mogl, ye bitno kinano si gi dinan, ye Satan kamo kibi i, kaima pamiwedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />God ye bitno kinano si gi di tenabuka i, yoba ta ye kamo kaima paugwa i pre mediglkre, mabuno kide pamara gun yei teigwa i, ka tage inaiglmedi pre yegl erabuka.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pre mediglkwa yoba ye adigl gigledi moraiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Yoba ta God kamo pre mediglkrikwa i, God ka tage tenabuka ba agroma abaroma wagle, ene meglkwa i, God dem muduo ene togwa meglkwa. No ene pre ege ege God di wakai yei tenamga paugwa. I siragl pre God ene ere yugwa, meglkwa. God okna kaima ibo ka ta di paduglkwa i, ene ye kamo kaima i pre mediglbi, ye Murubuglomo ene God yobama moraiglmedi i pere edenan, ye ene ere inagledi, ka yegl mere di padigl kodugwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Ye okna ibo ka yegl mere di padiglsre, okuo no Jisas kamo wakai ene di tomnara i mina ene ede suna unaiglmedi agle dugwa. Ye ene agle dugwa i, ene Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais abuglagemo sumara moglsre, wakai kaima moraiglmedi pre agle dugo, ene ede suna wigwa.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Yegl pre agroma abaroma wagle, no God kamo ene okna beke tomgo, ene prikwa i, ene ake gi di moglsre, adigl gigledi molo! No ene bogl akie munga igne drano mina ene ka beke tomga i ya te, pepa boglsre, ene beke tomga i, ene ka mudu i ake gi di moraiglkwa pre diga.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Nono Neno Kade God i, ye dem muduo norsre, yoko kaima ere wakai ere noro, nono deno muduno mina aimadi kamin wakai praiglmedi ere noruko, nono taragl wakai okuo plau dinabedi prisre, sugl munga. Yegl pre no erme ene pre kamage erumga i, Neno Kade God ya nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais yene <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />ene deno muduno si gigle di tedre, ene ake ple di tebr, ene ka dinaiglmara ya mabuno eraiglmara i mina ene wakai ersre, adigl gigledi moraiglmedi, no kamage erumga.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Ka dudumara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, na ka di wiga dudumara i, yegl dinaglka, ene no pre kamage ere norio. Ene kamage eraiglkwa i, Yaglno Kade kamo tabre pare wai dinan, ene okna ye kamo primere yegl, yoba ye kamo prisre, ka i, God kamo kaima yomiwedi pre, pre i mitna edinaiglmedi kamage erio. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Yoba mudu ta God kamo pre mediglkrikwa pre yoba tau ye pre mediglkre, yoba kide kaima ta meglkwa i, no ere kide ere noramnedi erikwa. Ye yegl erikwa pre yoba i ta no ere kide ere noramnedi eribi, God ye konbono si kegl dinabedi kamage ere norio.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Yoba tau mere God kamo pre mediglkre, no ere kide ere noramnedi erikwa ba nono Yaglno Kade moglkwa i, ege ege ka dumara adigl moglkwa pre ye ene yobuglo bogl tedre, yagl kide ene ere kide ere te dinabedi kugl bogl te pai morabuka.<verse eid="2TH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Ana Yagl Kade erme nomane ta noruko, no pre pogl sumga i, no ene ka di tomnere i, ene erme ere moglsre, te okuo ama ere pai moraiglmedi nomane yegl noruko, no prumga.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Te, no erme ene pre kamage erumga i, nono Yaglno Kade Krais ene deno muduno mina kogon eran, God ene siragl mere dem muduo togwa i, ene pre pogl sidre, adigl gigledi moraiglmedi kamage erumga.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Ana agroma abaroma wagle, no erme Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais dra idre, ene ka di tomga i, yegl mere paugwa, pre mediglkwa yoba ta no ka beke tomnere yegl erekre, yoko wan mogl, kogon ta erekrikwa i, ene ye bogl akie wan moglkrio. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Enene prikwa i, no ene bogl akie munga igne, no ene mabuno siragl mere eraiglkwa paugwa i, obuno wakai di tomga. Yegl pre ene no mabuno erumga i kandre, erumnere mere yegl eraiglkwa paugwa. No kogon erekre, yoko ta wan moglkrumga.<verse eid="2TH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Te, no ene bogl akie munga igne, no yoba swara ta kaya mokna yoko yu norio dikrumga ba no topo sidre, keme kaya mokna i nomga. No ene yubun te dinamnedi prisre, ermine ya eduer akie kogon podo ersre, taragl ta inamga pamere mere no nono kogon ersre, i nomga. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />No ene ake ple di norio dinamga i, kuno erukwa ba ene ebrie mabuno siragl mere beglbi, wakai panabuka i, no obuno di tenamnedi prisre, kogon podo erumga. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Te, no ene bogl akie munga igne, ka gigledi di padunga i, ene kor poglo di prio! No dumga i, Yoba ta kogon erakiure, yoko morabuka i, ye ama kaya mokna ta nekrabiwe di, yegl dumga.<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ene yoko moglkre, kogon erio dumga i, i siragl pre yoba di noriko, prumga i, ene meglmara suna i yoba tau kogon erakiure, yoko meglme digwa. Ye kogon erekre, kogon ta paikrumara i, yoko u ikne ikne pi, wan meglmiwe digo, prumga. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />No Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais dra idre, yoba yoko wan meglkwa i yegl di tomga, ye kiede mogl, ye yene kogono ersre, kaya mokna i nenaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ba ene agroma abaroma tau mabuno kide yegl ta erekre, kogon ere meglkwa i, ene wakai erikwa pre ene oglka erekre, mabuno wakai ere pai molo.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ana no pepa magigl i mina ene mabuno tau erio didre, mabuno tau erekrio didre, erumga i, ene meglmara suna i, yoba ta no dumnere mere duglo boglkran, ye mabunomo i, ene moraiglmara i di nogugl edidre, ye bogl akie wan moglkrio. Ene yegl eribi, ye agai goglsre, nomane kor inabuka paugwa. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ene yoba i bogl akie wan moglkraiglkwa ba ene ye kudano ikne mere yegl moglmedi kankrio. No agro kra moglmedi kandre, ye mabuno kide ere pai mogl dinabedi ka gigledi di teo.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Ana Yagl Kade moglkwa i, ye yene deno muduno wida di padigl norukwa yagl moglkwa pre taragl kane kane, wakai mo kide plau dinan, ye swara ene deno muduno wida di padigl tedre, ene mudu meglmara ege ege mogl tenabedi kamage erumga.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Paul dictates a letter" file="FM 208 Paul Dicatates a Letter_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="foundation Matters" ref="3.17" />Ana na ka tau di ede wiga i, agra ta di teigo, ye bogl atne ede narukwa ba erme pepa dudumara i, na nana ogona mina ka boglsre, ene wakai we di teiga. Na yoba pere pere pepa bogl teiga igne, pepa dudumara ege ege yegl erika pre ene na ka siragl mere boglka i kandre, Pol kaima boglmedi kan pogl sinaiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Ana na prika i, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais ene yoko kaima ere wakai ere te pai morabedi prika.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>